{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49682","headline":"虞美人 一 · 阎选","name":"虞美人 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"粉融红腻莲房绽，脸动双波慢。\n小鱼衔玉鬓钗横，石榴裙染象纱轻，转娉婷。\n偷期锦浪荷深处，一梦云兼雨。\n臂留檀印齿痕香，深秋不寐漏初长，尽思量。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"阎选","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49682.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49682","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}